Streamline Free License

This package contains icons from Streamline (https://streamlinehq.com).

Some of these icons are licensed under Creative Commons 4.0 Attribution (CC BY 4.0).
Other icons are free to use under Streamline's free license but are not open-source.

Attribution is required for CC BY 4.0 licensed icons:

You must give appropriate credit and provide a link to https://streamlinehq.com.

For web applications and websites:
Include a link to https://streamlinehq.com on all pages where these icons are used,
or place it in a Credits or About page.

For desktop and mobile apps:
Add the proper credit in the "About" or "Credits" page.

For other content like books, videos, images, T-shirts, documents:
Add the link anywhere in the document or product.

This package uses the following icon sets from Streamline:
- UI Icons Line (free vector set)
- Various individual icons from Streamline's collection

For more information about Streamline's licensing, see:
https://help.streamlinehq.com/en/articles/5354376-streamline-free-license